    "canadianDeviation": "Unit action of the wind speed on any line component or element\n[Add the following]\nThe air density correction factor shall be 1.04 for wind conditions without ice and 1.1 for combined ice\nand wind. These factors may also be used for mountainous regions because the reduced temperature\ncompensates for the altitude.\nNote 1A: Two factors are specified because two separate weather events are considered:\n(a) wind; and\n(b) wind plus ice.\nDifferent temperatures are associated with these two weather events."
