    "canadianDeviation": "Supports with cylindrical members having a large diameter\n(dt > 0,2 m)\n[Change the clause title to “Supports with cylindrical members having a large diameter and pole structures”]\n[Add the following paragraph]\nA value of 1.0 for drag coefficient of wood poles may be used as an alternative to the detailed calculations\nof Clause 6.2.6.4.2."
