    "canadianDeviation": "Strength factor S related to the coordination of strength\n[Add the following paragraph after Table 13]\nDespite the prescription of a preferred sequence of failure, the line can fail in a different mode. For\nexample, conductors can break due to overstressing caused by a collapsed tower rather than from\noverload. Dead-end insulators can also fail due to dynamic loads caused by adjacent tower failures."
