    "canadianDeviation": "Support design strength\n[Add the following paragraph after Table 20]\nThe following default (simplified) values may be used for lattice steel towers in the majority of lines:\n(a) suspension towers: R = 0.9 for intact loading cases and R = 1.0 for failure loading cases; and\n(b) angle and dead-end towers: intact R = 0.8 and failed system R = 0.9\nwhere R = N S Q C"
